      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/31-crayfishes-shrimps-crabs-snails-mussels/panther_crabs_from_sulawesi_en/",
      "html": "<p>Like almost all crabs, they are omnivorous. However, most food items taken are of animal origin.</p>"
